cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, the model or the data, please cite the article in preferred-citation."
title: "fuel-mapping-CA: sub-meter mapping of trees, shrubs and buildings in California from NAIP imagery"
abstract: >-
  Code, model weights and labelled data for Zhu, Dixon and Jin (2026), Remote Sensing of
  Environment 333, 115091: a U-Net that maps trees, shrubs and building footprints at 0.6 m
  from NAIP imagery, with a semi-automatic LiDAR-based labelling workflow. Code: GPL-3.0-only;
  data, labels and model weights: CC BY 4.0 (see LICENSE-DATA.md).
